meta {
  name: Get Patient HIE documents
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/patients/:patientId/hie-docs
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  patientId: {{patientId}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Gets a list of HIE documents for the patient by ID. These can be downloaded via their `url` property. Partner-facing document display text fields are returned without literal `|` separators. Identifiers, URLs, statuses, dates, splice metadata, and source metadata are preserved as received.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `patientId` | Unique identifier of the patient. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
  {
    "partnerPatientId": "a15ee663-f259-7580-edce-940d3fb9e19f",
    "hieDocs": [
      {
        "id": "de35a03e-80cd-c57c-b7e8-c06fed3cf270",
        "createdAt": "1976-12-25T23:35:14.208Z",
        "title": "string",
        "image": {
          "id": "0ec40b57-e077-1f86-83f9-5e75fa7c6870",
          "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
          "createdAt": "2025-04-08T01:05:44.883Z"
        },
        "images": [
          {
            "id": "934133ad-e40b-9abe-a19c-63a3538b4daf",
            "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
            "createdAt": "2008-01-26T22:07:47.797Z"
          },
          {
            "id": "0f3d7fce-cf9c-804a-ae79-9a995ac74dfc",
            "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
            "createdAt": "1988-12-04T04:19:22.141Z"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "f052b74d-1b53-29ad-af13-7f6615438d0a",
        "createdAt": "2012-06-02T11:00:09.191Z",
        "title": "string",
        "image": {
